1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,589
What happens if you swallow your chewing gum?

2
00:00:02,849 --> 00:00:04,369
Your body can't digest it.

3
00:00:04,629 --> 00:00:07,956
Gum base is a synthetic rubber your stomach ignores.

4
00:00:08,216 --> 00:00:09,876
But ignored doesn't mean stuck.

5
00:00:10,136 --> 00:00:12,151
Your gut muscles just push it through.

6
00:00:12,411 --> 00:00:15,271
One piece usually leaves within a few days.

7
00:00:15,531 --> 00:00:17,913
The seven years myth is just that, a myth.

8
00:00:18,173 --> 00:00:21,069
But swallow gum every day, and it can pile up.

9
00:00:21,329 --> 00:00:24,343
Doctors have pulled out hard gum masses from kids.

10
00:00:24,602 --> 00:00:27,156
Some even needed surgery for the blockage.

11
00:00:27,416 --> 00:00:29,758
So gum is for chewing, not swallowing.

12
00:00:30,018 --> 00:00:32,023
Your gut forgives once, not a habit.
